records.rationale:
In `sendAddGuestsEmails`, the code sends the re-confirmation (`AttendeeScheduledEmail`) only when `newGuests.includes(attendee.email)` is true; otherwise it sends `AttendeeAddGuestsEmail`:

```ts
if (newGuests.includes(attendee.email)) {
  return sendEmail(() => new AttendeeScheduledEmail(calendarEvent, attendee));
} else {
  return sendEmail(() => new AttendeeAddGuestsEmail(calendarEvent, attendee));
}
```

So if there is a case mismatch between `newGuests` and an existing attendee’s `attendee.email`, `includes(...)` will be false and they will receive the guests-added email, not a re-confirm
